** Deliberately hourglass-prone: C3D8R with ONE element through the thickness and
** relaxed-stiffness hourglass control, in impulsive bending. Reduced integration
** cannot resist the zero-energy modes at this discretisation, so artificial
** strain energy carries the load instead of the material.
** Abaqus still reports COMPLETED. That is the entire point of the validity gate.
